{"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Trial Site News: \"COVID-19 Vaccines Linked to Painful Genital Ulcers in Adolescent Girls\u2014New Study Raises Safety Questions.\" Not one microsecond of accountability. YET! This is never going away, Demons. Better come up with a plan. \"Pretend like it never happened\" is not the one.", "last_comment_created": 1793577597100, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 1, "score_up": 38, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"description": "Japanese researchers report a striking increase in vulvar ulcer reports following COVID-19 vaccination, particularly among adolescent girls. But do the findings establish a vaccine-related injury&mdash;or reveal an important safety signal requiring stronger investigation?A new study led by Makio Shozu and colleagues, titled Association Between Acute Vulvar Ulcers and Gene-Based COVID-19 Vaccines, published in the November 2026 issue of the Taiwanese Journal of Obstetrics and Gynecology, analyzed U.S. vaccine safety reports and found that adolescent girls aged 12&ndash;17 had approximately four times the reported ulcer rate of women aged 25&ndash;39. Their estimated reporting rate was 46 times that observed after HPV vaccination. The findings raise a potential reproductive-health safety concern, although the researchers acknowledge that causation remains unproven.", "large_image": "Qql7RSIStAYarnv7.png", "title": "COVID-19 Vaccines Linked to Rare, Painful Genital Ulcers in Adolescent Girls\u2014New Study Raises Safety Questions"}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToUKHqtR", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 29, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "